## Session Structure Suggestion (20 minutes)

| Time | Activity | Focus |
|------|----------|-------|
| 3 min | Dynamic warm-up (leg swings, hip activation) | Muscle activation, joint mobility |
| 7 min | Nordic Hamstring Exercise (grouped) | Eccentric strength, controlled lowering |
| 5 min | Hip-dominant exercise (RDL or sliders) | Biceps femoris long head activation |
| 5 min | Core stability (plank, side plank) | Supporting stability for hamstring function |

