## Assessment Indicators

A player has improved when they:
1. Can **control the eccentric lowering phase** of NHE without losing control
2. Demonstrates **increased eccentric hamstring strength** over 4–12 weeks
3. Maintains **high adherence** (≥75% of prescribed sessions)
4. Shows **reduced hamstring discomfort** during high-speed running and changes of direction

